                                    <tr><td class="subheader"> Potential triggers (individual or collective) for a downward rating action:</td></tr>
                                            <tr><td class="class11">  <div style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">­</span></span></div>

<ul>
	<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">Deterioration in asset quality metrics as reflected by GNPA increasing beyond 6%</span></span></li>
	<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">Any sharp deterioration in capital position&nbsp;with capital adequacy coming closer to the regulatory minimum</span></span></li>
	<li style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">Any unexpected reduction of support from GoI</span></span></li>
</ul>
</td></tr>
